NOTE ON CONTENT

The MIT license above covers the SOURCE CODE of this project only.

The regulatory text, agency listings, and structural data this project ingests come from
the electronic Code of Federal Regulations (eCFR), published by the Office of the Federal
Register and the Government Publishing Office. As a work of the United States government,
that content is in the public domain under 17 U.S.C. § 105.

Word counts, rollups, overlap analysis, and any other figures produced by this project are
DERIVED MEASUREMENTS generated by this project's parser. They are not published by, endorsed
by, or verified by any government agency, and they may contain errors. See /methodology.

This site is not an official edition of the Code of Federal Regulations and is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Office of the Federal Register, the
Government Publishing Office, the National Archives and Records Administration, or any
United States government agency. For official text, consult https://www.ecfr.gov.
